            <li style="margin-left: 27.6pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 8.4pt;">risks associated with our use of AI;</li>
            <li style="margin-left: 27.6pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 8.4pt;">competition from the emergence or growth of other digital assets accelerated by advancements in AI and blockchain technology;</li>
            <li style="margin-left: 27.6pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 8.4pt;">the reliance of our AI technology on the use of third-party data;</li>
